Cell["\<\
This experiment demonstrates supervised learning  using topological \
associative memory. Raw images have been preprocessed with Gaussian blur.
Image data is encoded as sparse distributed representations (SDRs), using  a \
random sparse projection followed by k-winners-take-all. We encode labels as \
non-overlapping random sparse holographic representations (SHRs).
\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"86cc569a-be37-4aff-8a57-73ac76739a7f"],

